/-!
# LocalGamma1: operator-norm certificates for the coupling block γ₁ (`local/LOCAL_LEMMA.md` §2)

GENERATED by `lean/gen/export_local_bench.py` (data from `local_pre.py`); do not edit the data block.

`A_α = ½ D²F₃(ŝ_α)` (14×14 over K = ℚ(α)), so that `3C(s,w,w) = σ₁ wᵀA₁w + σ₂ wᵀA₂w` for `s = σ₁ŝ₁ + σ₂ŝ₂`.
For each α and each sign the matrix `c·I ∓ A_α + λ·KKᵀ` (K = the five kernel vectors) is certified PSD by an exact
LDLᵀ with dyadic data plus a diagonally dominant remainder enclosed on a rational α-box (`decide +kernel`).
On `W = ker Kᵀ` this gives `|wᵀA_αw| ≤ c|w|²`, hence `|3C(s,w,w)| ≤ c(|σ₁|+|σ₂|)|w|² ≤ G1x3·a·|w|²` with
`a² = (5/2)(σ₁²+σ₂²) = |s|²` and `G1x3 = 233445497/200000000 ≥ 2c/√5` (this is `3γ₁`).
Constants: c = 261/200, λ = 100.
-/

